{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Current owned private native page read",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Read-only same current actor/session/Portfolio and exact accepted proof as content completion. Existing canonical native workflow reader supplies current body, page/context hashes and observed time. Original creator candidates and private_write_snapshot remain immutable and separate. Document body uses the shared native V2 block schema; no HTML/script renderer or arbitrary studio URL. Media descriptors exclude filesystem src, original input, prompt and rights metadata. Typed same-site page links resolve through document.links within this current owned inventory; external links are actionable only for exact verified current source URLs. Canonical network/commerce nodes remain lossless body data but render as non-actionable text; no cross-site resolver or purchase authority. document_sha256 is canonical SHA256 of the whitelisted document, distinct from full page revision SHA. Binary media is attached to this page, exact current revision, bytes and SHA; mismatched revision409, foreign/missing scope404 and corrupt adapter503. Auth/source/session are rechecked after subprocess. No provider calls, approval, release, Source/Profile or channel activation. Inherited workflow gates and language UNVERIFIED."
  },
